       "_key": "000000000001",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ],
       "text": "11-Day Egypt Tour of History"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000002",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ". Start in Cairo with the iconic Pyramids of Giza, the treasures of the "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000004",
