       "marks": [
        "000000000006"
       ],
       "text": "Khan El Khalili"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000008",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " Bazaar. Fly to Aswan to visit the impressive High Dam and the serene Philae Temple, then embark on a Nile cruise with an unforgettable excursion to "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000009"
       ],
       "text": "Abu Simbel"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000b",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", marveling at these monumental temples."
