       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000011"
       ],
       "text": "Hurghada"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000013",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " for three days of relaxation, water adventures, and beachside leisure. Conclude your journey in Cairo with visits to the ancient capital of Memphis, the pyramids of Saqqara, and the historic treasures of Old Cairo. This tour captures Egypt’s history, beauty, and coastal charm, offering an unforgettable exploration of this timeless land."
      }
     ],
